{"book":"2-kings","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:23:55.292112494Z","verse":5,"ref":"2-kings 20:5","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":20,"translation":"Turn back, and say to Hezekiah, the prince of my people: Thus says YHWH, the Elohim of David your father: I have heard your prayer, I have seen your tears; behold, I ⟨will⟩ heal you; on the third day you shall go up to the house of YHWH.","tokens":[{"surface":"שוב","gloss":"Return"},{"surface":"ואמרת","gloss":"and say"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"to"},{"surface":"חזקיהו","gloss":"Hezekiah"},{"surface":"נגיד","gloss":"leader"},{"surface":"עמי","gloss":"of my people"},{"surface":"כה","gloss":"Thus"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"says"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"Elohim"},{"surface":"דוד","gloss":"of David"},{"surface":"אביך","gloss":"your father"},{"surface":"שמעתי","gloss":"I have heard"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your prayer"},{"surface":"תפלתך","gloss":"your prayer"},{"surface":"ראיתי","gloss":"I have seen"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your tears"},{"surface":"דמעתך","gloss":"your tears"},{"surface":"הנני","gloss":"behold I"},{"surface":"רפא","gloss":"healing you"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"you"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"on the day"},{"surface":"השלישי","gloss":"the third day"},{"surface":"תעלה","gloss":"you will go up"},{"surface":"בית","gloss":"⟨to⟩ the house"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"of YHWH"}]}